{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29023","headline":"赠萧兵曹先辈 · 许浑","name":"赠萧兵曹先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"广陵堤上昔离居，帆转潇湘万里余。\n楚客病时无鵩鸟，越乡归处有鲈鱼。\n潮生水郭蒹葭响，雨过山城橘柚疎。\n闻说携琴兼载酒，邑人争识马相如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29023.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29023","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}